V3.10 - 2026-11-09
	Fix black screen with audio on PS5 ProsperoSunshine by rendering hardware-concealed error frames during Periodic Intra-Refresh (PIR) sweeps
	Restore 30-frame drop timeout for WaitingForIdr before falling back to Running without dropping the frame
	Require 5 consecutive decode errors before entering WaitingForIdr to prevent cyclic drop loops on transient reference errors
	Preserve 256-byte stride alignment for HEVC maxFrameWidth to prevent SCE_VIDEODEC2_ERROR_OVERSIZE_DECODE errors
	Fix new pairing connection failures ("Connecting" -> "failed") by querying connected local pads dynamically and reverting gcmap to canonical 0
	Remove strict launch metadata rejections and provide canonical fallbacks for missing serverCodecModeSupport or appversion (restoring NVIDIA GFE, Vibeshine, and Sunshine compatibility)

V3.00 - 2026-11-07
	Implement 250 Hz high-frequency controller input and motion streaming on a dedicated background thread
	Add multi-touch touchpad gestures: 1-finger sub-pixel cursor movement, 2-finger vertical and horizontal scrolling, and dual-finger clicks
	Support gyroscope and accelerometer (IMU) motion sensor passthrough with automatic rad/s to deg/s and m/s^2 conversion
	Add native DualShock 4 touchpad click button (TOUCHPAD_FLAG) and split touchpad click (Left half = Select, Right half = Touchpad)
	Add radial stick deadzone scaling (0%, 5%, 8%, 10%, 15%, 20%) to eliminate stick drift without step jumps
	Add host face button swap (Cross <-> Circle, Square <-> Triangle) option while preserving local PS4 UI navigation
	Add new GAMEPAD section in Settings overlay with persistent INI configuration
	Pass active multi-controller bitmap (15 / 0x0F) in /launch and /resume query strings for proper virtual gamepad provisioning
	Expand built-in Help page with complete in-stream shortcuts, touchpad gestures, and hardware passthrough guide

V2.80 - 2026-11-07
	Automatically attempt up to 3 stream reconnects (with 2s backoff and serverinfo refresh) on unexpected connection drops
	Forward CONN_STATUS_POOR / CONN_STATUS_OKAY callbacks and render an in-stream Poor Connection warning banner
	Show Reconnecting (X/3)..., Connection lost, Connect failed, and Launch failed status text on App List and App Grid cards
	Ensure GpuVideoRenderer creates a valid 16x16 black NV12 dummy texture on initialization and clears active surfaces before stream start
	Make VideoDecoder request periodic IDR keyframes every 250 ms while awaiting IDR recovery and re-request IDR on transient Vdec2 decode errors
	Draw a 2-second "Connecting to stream..." status indicator if the first video frame has not yet arrived

V2.70 - 2026-11-07
	Forward L3 unconditionally and replay buffered 80 ms Options pulse when released before 1s exit hold
	Evaluate L1 + R1 + Options -> PS/Guide and exit chord state machines every frame for exact 80 ms pulse timing
	Bypass button-chord state machines on neutral controller packets and scope P1 chords strictly to Controller 1
	Protect controller slot polling with padMutex and support black (off) RGB light bar overrides from host games
	Improve manual host hostname vs. IPv4 handling and RFC 1123 hostname validation in Add Host dialog
	Consolidate serverinfo codec mode defaults and prevent unreferenced P-frame decode loops during IDR recovery
	Make legacy Moonlight DX storage import atomic via temporary files and non-destructive checks
	Resolve libssl1.1 package dynamically from Ubuntu archive in Docker build environment

V2.60 - 2026-11-07
	Add UTF-8 multi-byte codepoint decoding to FontRasterizer (fixes ™, symbols, and accents)
	Add UTF-8 boundary-safe ellipsis truncation for long titles
	Adjust card grid layout to cleanly fit 2 full rows (5x2 = 10 cards) without bottom legend overlap
	Add text clipping to FontRasterizer/UiCompositor and redraw bar backgrounds to prevent bleed
	Add aspect-cover (center crop) rendering for Desktop card and posters for uniform card sizes
	Center on-screen keyboard (IME) dialog horizontally and vertically on display
	Fix video decoder packet starvation during PC stream launch and IDR recovery
	Schedule serverinfo query on stream exit to refresh resume/running status

